-- addresses without a port
192.168.1.1 -> 192.168.1.1 (v4)
:: -> :: (v6)
::1 -> ::1 (v6)
2001:db8::8:800:200c:417a -> 2001:db8::8:800:200c:417a (v6)
ff01::101 -> ff01::101 (v6)
0:0:0:0:0:0:0:0 -> :: (v6)
1.2.3.4:5 -> not an address
[::1] -> not an address
-- resolve
localhost has a loopback address with the port
127.0.0.1 resolves to 1 address: 127.0.0.1:9
[::1]:9
an empty name is InvalidInput
a name with a NUL byte is InvalidInput
127.0.0.1:7
[::1]:7
